# Real env files must never be tracked (added 6 Aug 2026).
# The CRA-default list above misses names like .env.events.local and .env.staging.local,
# which is how .env.events.local sat in this PUBLIC repo from 25 Nov 2025.
# .env.example stays tracked deliberately — it holds placeholders, not values.
.env*.local
.env.*.local

# review renders (scripts/render-fixture.mjs output) — regenerated, never committed
render/

# design-loop render artefacts (regenerable, multi-MB)
index-render/
